/**
 * MECHANICAL DESIGN.
 *
 * The MECHANICAL track. Everything here is sized for a robot you can build on a
 * desk: gearmotors, printed brackets, M3 hardware, 608 bearings. The arithmetic
 * is real - gear ratios, bolt preload, bearing loads, motor selection - because
 * a mechanism you cannot calculate is a mechanism you are guessing at.
 *
 * DAG: mech-01 -> mech-02 -> mech-05, mech-03 -> mech-04, mech-03 -> mech-06,
 *      mech-03 -> mech-07, mech-01 -> mech-08, mech-02 -> mech-09 -> mech-10.
 */
